m and it was  very i was very very thankful to have so  many people reach out and be like oh  it's so great to see somebody like you  on tv representing our community  especially when it really hasn't been  represented in any real way and my goal  out there like i knew i could go in with  the burden of having to represent a  community but i purposely  intentionally put that aside to some  extent because i was like i think that  will only hurt my game so i wanted to be  authentic to myself  and play the game kind of separate from  that but it was very special for  survivor to still share that part of me  because i did i do think it meant a lot  to a lot of people and growing up it  would have meant a lot to me to see as  well um so i'm hoping that feeling that  i had where you know our people didn't  really belong on a platform like this or  we were lucky  you know to be around other people who  were more important than us  i hope that little kids now don't feel  that way because they have someone to  represent them  and i think that that's why you were so  popular with the viewers because we got  to see this human side of you and we  also got to see you play the game and i  think that yes you were a popular player  i know you were popular here at et  canada too i know people speak highly of  you so i've got to ask what was it like  representing canada on 42  i am so proud to be canadian honestly  like i think it's the best country in  the world i think that we're so  fortunate enough in canada to have so  many opportunities that we wouldn't  otherwise have and my parents came here  for a better life um for their family so  um i've been so blessed by this nation  and i i love how patriotic canada is and  how they get behind their people and  it's just been so  amazing to represent the country that i  love so much and i hope that i did them  proud  you definitely made canada proud with  your performance out there and now so  there's one episode left you're going to  be on the jury so now that you're going  to be a juror what are you looking for  in the winner for survivor 42  i think for me i'm very open to voting  honestly for any of them in the final  three as long as they can demonstrate  what their game was and for me it's very  important to have intentionality behind  that game so you can play any strategy  you want  whether it's a popular strategy or not  based on like very arbitrary guidelines  set by fans but it's like if you play  the best game that you set out to play  no matter what that strategy was and you  were intentional about it i respect that  so for me i'm gonna vote for whoever  played the game that has the most  self-awareness and intention behind it  and that's important for me  amazing well omar it was so fun to watch  you it was so fun to have you represent  canada i wish you all the best as you  spread your wings and you head off to  whatever the next adventure is and  thanks so much for chatting today thank  you so much and bring more birds into  your life you'll be happy  [Laughter]  you
 

